  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Synechocystis seed cultures were routinely cultivated and maintained in liquid BG11 medium [19] or 1.25% BG11 agar plates under 30 μmol photons m−2 s−1 at 30 °C, with proper antibiotics supplemented."
